765	     * Compute an owner's {@code fiscalYear}, the fiscal year of a date formatted {@code 'FY<YY>'}
766	     * where {@code YY} is the last two digits of the fiscal-year number (see
767	     * {@link #fiscalYearNumber(LocalDate)}). The fiscal year starts on 1 July, so a date of
768	     * {@code 2026-08-01} yields {@code 'FY27'} and {@code 2026-03-01} yields {@code 'FY26'}.
